  "details": "- CVE-2026-13321: check every NSEC record of an RRset against the signer zone,\n  not only the first one, on top of the vendor fix\n- CVE-2026-19668: bound the DS to DNSKEY matching in validate_dnskey() so a\n  crafted DS and DNSKEY pair cannot force unbounded key tag and digest work\n- CVE-2026-77119: ignore an NSEC3 whose zone does not enclose the DS name when\n  proving an insecure delegation",
